{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012170200301-1012_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261012175209\"/><p>霍爾（左）及伍德福德（右）獲2026年諾貝爾經濟學獎。</p><p>瑞典皇家科學院周一（12日）宣布，向美國學者霍爾（Robert Hall）及伍德福德（Michael Woodford）授予2026年諾貝爾經濟學獎，以表彰他們在宏觀經濟穩定方面的微觀經濟基礎研究。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:59:44.015222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:49.751495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:43.584452+00:00","content_hash":"c5098f23f7910a41fd337e3db9e0633d3e4a2ece223bc12e11ee9a921499bf63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}